# Second line of defence for `mcpb pack`, which already drops .git, .env*,
# *.mcpb, *.d.ts, *.map, node_modules/.bin and the lockfiles on its own.
#
# scripts/build-mcpb.mjs stages the bundle explicitly, so everything below is
# already absent by the time packing starts. It is written out anyway because a
# staging change should not be able to ship a secret by accident, and because
# `mcpb pack .` in a clone has to be safe too.
.env
.env.*
.dev.vars
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.mcpb
node_modules/.bin/
